/************** Fim de variaveis de selecao *******/

DEF NEW GLOBAL SHARED VAR L-Implanta              AS   LOG    INIT NO.
DEF NEW GLOBAL SHARED VAR C-Seg-Usuario           AS   CHAR   FORM "x(12)" NO-UNDO.
